  } ]
  "whitelist": [ {
      "term": <string>,
      "reason": <string>   (optional),
  } ]
}
</GUARD_VOCABULARY>

Submit the concrete terms that would VIOLATE the stated guard rule for this story, and the terms that represent its legitimate observable surface. Derive them from the supplied code evidence. Do not answer in prose.


